    "domain": "Natural Sciences",
    "framing": "How did physicists establish whether the anomalous perihelion precession of Mercury reflected an undiscovered intra-Mercurial planet or a defect in Newtonian gravitation itself?",
    "split": "test",
    "word_count": 455,
    "generator": "claude-opus-5",
